on, and Shuthelah his son, and Ezer, and Elead, whom the men of Gath that were born in that land slew, because they came down to take away their cattle.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙQAnd Ephraim their father mourned many days, and his brethren came to comfort him.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses•„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙƒAnd when he went in to his wife, she conceived, and bare a son, and he called his name Beriah, because it went evil with his house.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ`(And his daughter was Sherah, who built Beth-horon the nether, and the upper, and Uzzen-sherah.)¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙKAnd Rephah was his son, also Resheph, and Telah his son, and Tahan his son,¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ2Laadan his son, Ammihud his son, Elishama his son,¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤text¿Non his son, Jehoshuah his son.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses’„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙĞAnd their possessions and habitations were, Beth-el and the towns thereof, and eastward Naaran, and westward Gezer, with the towns thereof; Shechem also and the towns thereof, unto Gaza and the towns thereof:¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙÃand by the borders of the children of Manasseh, Beth-shean and her towns, Taanach and her towns, Megiddo and her towns, Dor and her towns. In these dwelt the children of Joseph the son of Israel.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse'¦versesš„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙTThe sons of Asher; Imnah, and Isuah, and Ishuai, and Beriah, and Serah their sister.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙLAnd the sons of Beriah; Heber, and Malchiel, who is the father of Birzavith.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse ¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙGAnd Heber begat